pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
notes: 仓库结构：左侧目录树（无边框表格保证行对齐），右侧解释渐进式披露。
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 52, 400, 16]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: "05 · 结构"

  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 76, 828, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: 一张为智能体画的地图，而不是手册

  - elementId: title-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [66, 128, 828, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}

  # 左：目录树（固定行高的双文本列，行行对齐）
  - elementId: tree-names
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 150, 230, 312]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeightPx: 28
      fontFamily: {latin: "Liter", ea: "MiSans"}
      text: |
        <p><strong>harness-engineering/</strong></p>
        <p>├─ README.md</p>
        <p><span style="color:$accent"><strong>├─ AGENTS.md</strong></span></p>
        <p>├─ concepts/</p>
        <p>├─ thinking/</p>
        <p>├─ practice/</p>
        <p>├─ feedback/</p>
        <p>├─ works/</p>
        <p>├─ tools/ · prompts/</p>
        <p>├─ references/</p>
        <p>└─ scripts/</p>

  - elementId: tree-notes
    elementType: text
    bounds: [312, 150, 258, 312]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$steel"
      lineHeightPx: 28
      fontFamily: {latin: "Liter", ea: "MiSans"}
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$faint">（仓库根）</span></p>
        <p>人类入口 · 学习路线与全景</p>
        <p><span style="color:$accent">智能体入口 · ~100 行的目录页</span></p>
        <p>概念笔记 · 拆解原文</p>
        <p>独立思考 · 质疑与延伸</p>
        <p>动手实践 · 小项目实验</p>
        <p>反馈记录 · 踩坑与迭代</p>
        <p>作品输出 · 翻译与原创</p>
        <p>工具杠杆库 · 提示词积累</p>
        <p>外部文章的深度摘要索引</p>
        <p>一致性检查（机械护栏）</p>

  # 右：渐进式披露
  - elementId: right-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [590, 152, 304, 48]
    content:
      fontSize: 17
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.35
      fontFamily: {latin: "Liter", ea: "得意黑"}
      text: 每个子目录，都有自己的 AGENTS.md

  - elementId: right-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [590, 210, 304, 84]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12.5
      color: "$steel"
      text: |
        <p>说明该目录的用途、组织方式与写作约定——从任何一个目录出发，都能找到下一步该看什么。入口很小，纵深按需展开。</p>

  # 渐进式披露小图
  - elementId: pd-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [590, 306, 304, 20]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$ink", fontFamily: {latin: "Liter", ea: "MiSans"}, wrap: false, text: 根 AGENTS.md —— 入口}
  - elementId: pd-a1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [600, 330, 12, 22]
    viewBox: [12, 22]
    points: "6,0 6,22"
    arrow: [null, stealth]
    border: {style: solid, width: 1.5, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: pd-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [590, 356, 304, 20]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$ink", fontFamily: {latin: "Liter", ea: "MiSans"}, wrap: false, text: 子目录 AGENTS.md —— 局部约定}
  - elementId: pd-a2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [600, 380, 12, 22]
    viewBox: [12, 22]
    points: "6,0 6,22"
    arrow: [null, stealth]
    border: {style: solid, width: 1.5, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: pd-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [590, 406, 304, 20]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$ink", fontFamily: {latin: "Liter", ea: "MiSans"}, wrap: false, text: 具体文档 —— 纵深}

  # 底部对比句
  - elementId: foot-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [66, 470, 828, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}

  - elementId: foot
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 480, 828, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$steel"
      fontFamily: {latin: "Liter", ea: "MiSans"}
      wrap: false
      text: 巨型指令文件的三个死因：挤占上下文 · 无法维护 · 无法机械验证——所以是地图，不是手册。
